From a21445178af611a7bf95d06ae3b9d202df8986ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joseph Liu <kwliu@nuvoton.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 14:09:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] spdmd: add bmc-direct composite EAT platform attester backend

Add the bmc_direct PlatformAttester backend, selected with
-Dattester-backend=bmc-direct-composite-eat. It encodes the composite EAT
request and submits it to the NPCM iRoT through the /dev/npcm-composite-eat
ioctl interface provided by the kernel mailbox client.

Vendor include/uapi/linux/npcm-composite-eat.h under
spdmd/bmc_direct/linux/ because linux-libc-headers does not export it.
It must stay identical to the kernel copy.

Upstream-Status: Pending
